OL,3,GNEWSATeen thanks paramedics who saved
OL,4,Alife after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy who suffered
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries in a bike
OL,8,Fcrash says he is happy to be back
OL,9,Friding after reuniting with the
OL,10,Fparamedics who treated him.
OL,12,FFourteen-year-old Adem suffered a brain
OL,13,Fhaemorrhage, facial fractures and lost
OL,14,Ftwo teeth after being thrown from his
OL,15,Fbike at Hove Pump Track in May.
OL,17,FAdem's mother, Eimear, also said she
OL,18,Fwill "always be grateful" to paramedics
OL,19,Ffor treating her son.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
