OL,3,GNEWSATeen thanks paramedics who saved
OL,4,Alife after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FParamedics involved in Adem's care also
OL,7,Fsaid his recovery showed the importance
OL,8,Fof wearing a helmet, which South East
OL,9,FCoast Ambulance Service said played a
OL,10,Fvital role in saving his life.
